sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as Meteorological Sensor / Gauge
    participant AI as AI Risk Inference Engine (XGBoost)
    participant DB as PostGIS Spatial Database
    actor Officer as EDRMC Disaster Officer (Human)
    participant Broadcaster as Celery Notification Engine
    actor Citizen as Citizens in Hazard Polygon (SMS/Push)
    actor Responders as Red Cross & Emergency Units

    Sensor->>AI: 1. Stream Rainfall & River Level Data
    AI->>AI: 2. Multi-Hazard Spatial Vulnerability Scoring
    AI->>DB: 3. Save Prediction (Status: PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW)
    Note over AI,DB: SAFETY RULE: AI CANNOT AUTO-PUBLISH ALERTS
    DB->>Officer: 4. Alert Desk Notification (High Risk Detected)
    Officer->>Officer: 5. Inspect Ground Evidence & Calibrate Severity
    Officer->>DB: 6. Authorize Alert (Digital Signature Attached)
    DB->>Broadcaster: 7. Trigger Multi-Channel Broadcast
    Broadcaster->>Citizen: 8. Send Geo-Fenced SMS Broadcast (Amharic & English)
    Broadcaster->>Responders: 9. Dispatch Emergency Tactical Directives
